,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.15426675,"data":"### Statistical Noise Floor \u0026 Leaderboard Resolution Analysis\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154291339,"data":"- **Converged 31B Pooled Rate:** 79 / 464 = **0.1703** (17.0%), Pooled SE = **0.0174** (n = 8 runs).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154294865,"data":"- **Within-Split Run-to-Run SD:** exp05-family sample SD = **0.89 tasks** (~0.015 score); theoretical binomial SD on fixed items: $\\sigma = \\sqrt{\\sum p_i(1-p_i)} \\approx 0.89\\text{--}1.5$ tasks.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154299743,"data":"- **Cross-Split Public-to-Private SE:** $\\text{SE} = \\sqrt{p(1-p)/58} \\approx$ **0.0503** (~**2.9 tasks** at p=0.179).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154303318,"data":"- **E0 Reproduction Control:** Byte-identical exp05 resubmission (sha256 `2ba7f9b1...`) scored 0.17 (10 tasks), proving exp05's 0.20 was a high draw within noise.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154306745,"data":"- **Leaderboard Resolution Limit:** No delta of $\\le 2$ tasks ($\\le 0.034$) is statistically resolvable on the public leaderboard without offline verification.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154310186,"data":"\n"}
