,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154783239,"data":"## Appendix — Wheel-Verified Runtime Mechanics \u0026 Proofs\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154786311,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154789085,"data":"1. **ADK 1.36.1 Compaction Constants:**\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154791984,"data":"   - `compaction_interval = 15`, `overlap = 2`, `event_retention = 5`, `token_threshold = 14336`.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154794962,"data":"   - Proof: Compaction strips tool outputs on `\u003cthink\u003e`-only turns. Plain-text `STATE:` header survives.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.15479815,"data":"2. **vLLM / LiteLLM Reasoning Drop:**\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.15480105,"data":"   - `chat_utils.py:1512` reads `message.get('reasoning')` without `reasoning_content` fallback, dropping thoughts between turns unless mirrored.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154804257,"data":"3. **vLLM 0.19.1 Thinking Budget Enforcement:**\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154807129,"data":"   - `builtin.py:294` (`ThinkingTokenBudgetLogitsProcessor`) hard-cuts thinking by setting end-of-think token logit to `1e9`.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154810223,"data":"4. **SkillToolset Security \u0026 Invariants:**\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154813398,"data":"   - Materializes in `tempfile.TemporaryDirectory()` (never `/workspace/skills`).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154816406,"data":"   - `run_skill_script` strictly requires `args` as a JSON list, not a dictionary.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":246.154845487,"data":"   - Default harness output is untruncated (`skill_toolset.py:689`); `swe-toolkit` enforces `OUT_CAP = 3500` chars.\n"}
